WEBVTT

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.080
Gosh...

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.850
We've come so far, but still nothing but forest...

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.610
I wish I were already in Geffen selling my wares.

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:23.920
Oh? I was hoping I could do more hunting.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.520
That's fine with me,

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.020
but I've heard this area's become more treacherous lately.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.860
We'll be fine!

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:36.560
Don't worry. I'll protect you, no matter what appears.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:39.030
With this!

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:40.970
That's so good to know.

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.510
We're counting on you.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:48.530
After I've made my money in Geffen,
I'll treat you to some apple cider.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:53.040
Huh?

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:58.020
Where'd everyone... Huh?

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:02.320
What's going on?
Where'd you all go?

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:05.490
This isn't funny!

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:07.660
Huh?!

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:42.800
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.770
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:49.270
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:53.780
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:59.580
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:03.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.630
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:18.930
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:24.470
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:31.610
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:37.090
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.520
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:46.460
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.730
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:52.800
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:55.300
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:59.840
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:05.650
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:08.550
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:42.550
Yuufa, we'd better be going.

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:44.020
Yuufa...

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:55.020
I'll be going now, my brother...

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.700
Thanks for waiting, Roan.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.030
Okay, let's go!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.970
Hurry!

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.650
The capital of Rune-Midgard is really something...

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.990
So many people.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:23.980
It's been so long since
I've been back.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.330
Say, Yuufa...

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:30.530
Wanna go and see the flowers by the west gate?

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:35.340
Or maybe buy some fruits at the market?

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:39.370
Yuufa, I know you're depressed after your brother's death, but...

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:42.240
Oh, these are so cute!

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.680
I have lots of good things.
Have a look.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:51.750
W-What do you want to do?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.920
Want to go to Izrut?

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:56.060
Morok, maybe?

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.760
Or maybe take the boat from Alberta?

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:00.700
Stop talking so much, Roan.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:05.430
I'm trying to decide between the hairband and the gas mask.

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:07.370
Uh, but...

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:11.110
Carry this, and this and this for me, Roan.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.110
You're buying all these?!

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:16.740
Um...Yuufa, what about the money?

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.650
This one's cute, too!

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:25.020
Make way! Make way!

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:27.590
I wonder why they're in such a hurry?

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.660
Seems the Orc attacked a group of travelers.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:33.430
That's all we hear about nowadays.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:37.130
Seems its true about the monsters becoming more violent.

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:40.800
Do you think it's related to the recent rash of quakes?

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:43.500
What is this world coming to?

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:49.380
It appears there are strange rumors about town...

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.680
Yes. Rumors of the monsters becoming more violent

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:56.580
and many like it are all over town.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:02.660
Last month, four travelers and a Pekopeko were attacked...

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:04.890
I received that report.

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.090
Yes, sir.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:10.160
But the four were all veteran adventurers....

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:15.170
It's hard to believe they were done in by a monster from Prontera....

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:18.610
Hmm... You may be right...

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:22.040
We have to consider them more than just rumors.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:26.810
The monsters... and many other strange things have been going on recently.

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:28.020
Yes, sir!

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:32.820
It's our duty to dispel the fears of Prontera's citizens.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.060
I will ride with you today.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.430
It's a bit early, but let's do a patrol.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.930
Accompany me.

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:40.660
Yes, sir!

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.870
That's odd...

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:51.670
The market's supposed to be this way...

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:54.740
Are you sure it's this way?

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:58.080
We've hardly passed anybody for some time now.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.510
Umm...

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:02.620
No, it's definitely this way!

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.110
Just a minute!

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.360
Whaddya want, lady?

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.830
You talking to us? Eh?

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.570
Oh... I get it...

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:19.400
You're in love with us, aren't you?

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:21.670
Wanna party?

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.470
You've got to be kidding,

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:27.640
if you think I'd go around with the filthy likes of you.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.110
What?!

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:30.810
Filthy?!

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.110
What'd you call us?!

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.640
Silence!

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.550
I want you two to...

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:39.190
...return what I collected.

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:39.820
What?!

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.390
What're you talking about?

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.460
Yes...

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:47.860
I've been following you all this time.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:54.640
You ran off with the item I collected during my hunt in the Myorni Mountains.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:57.840
You came all this way to complain about that?

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:01.040
You're a lot more petty than you look, lady.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.410
That's not the point!

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:07.010
I'm saying to follow the rules of being an Adventurer!

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:11.620
If you don't follow the rules, you're the worst sort of Adventurer.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.690
You're making a scene.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:15.950
What's all the commotion?

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:22.200
Who the hell is she?

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.400
Boss, she's...

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:27.840
This bitch is accusing us of something we don't know anything about....

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.740
Surely you know what I mean.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:33.970
I'm just asking you to go by the rules.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:45.720
We operate by our own rules.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.090
What we do is our business.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.490
You're...

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:50.990
The one who ran away

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:54.630
after setting a monster on some people, three days ago.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.300
Huh?!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:56.300
What?!

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.800
How do you know about that?!

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.700
Blindfolded, no less!

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.470
I can tell by your air.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.910
You have a peculiar smell.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.670
Smell?

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:08.740
You all stink.

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:10.140
Stink?!

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:13.680
I would never forget that cheap perfume.

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:15.550
Why you-

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:17.220
I've had it with you!

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:18.150
Guys!

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:19.590
Yeah!

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:22.620
We'll teach you to make fools of us!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.360
Oh dear...

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:28.160
Why won't you admit your own guilt?

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:28.930
Damn you!

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:30.670
She's still making fun of us!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.790
This is wrong!

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:36.500
It's three against one!

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:38.710
Y-Yuufa...

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:39.470
Huh?

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.440
Who're you?

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:44.280
Young lady, it isn't safe here.
Stand back.

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:46.850
No, I can't let this go on.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:50.350
If it's not one thing today, it's another...

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:55.790
Okay. But even with you, it's still three versus two.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:59.130
No, there's one more!

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:02.300
Roan! Hurry and come on out, Roan!

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.200
Roan!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.330
Aww!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.730
Roan!

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.330
Ohhh!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.500
Heck!

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.670
I'll take you on!

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:17.410
N-No... it's nothing.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:22.820
She's right... we were just asking directions.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.340
We'll be going now!

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:32.990
I sure showed you!
I'm Roan, the swordsman!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:34.160
Roan...

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.100
Huh?

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.360
Are you people okay?

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.070
Captain of the Prontera Cavalry...

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:44.010
Sir Helman!

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.940
It would seem...

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:49.140
this area has become a hotbed for undesirables.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:53.280
We come out on patrol every so often...

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:56.450
Looks like we arrived just in time.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:58.550
You truly saved us.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:02.060
Thanks to you, we avoided an unnecessary fight.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:03.820
Thank you very much.

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:07.320
Yes... do be careful.

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:11.700
I'm so glad...

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.270
Let's get going.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.070
Yeah. Uh... okay.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.000
Just a minute.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.070
Yes?

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:21.840
I am Takius, a magician.
Please allow me to thank you for today.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.610
Huh? Are you sure about that?

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.250
But...

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:29.180
You both came to my assistance.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:30.850
Please allow me to show my gratitude.

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.360
What blasted luck!

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:39.090
What were cavaliers doing in a place like this?

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:41.600
That's how dangerous it's gotten lately.

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:43.630
What is wrong with you two?!

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:45.070
Boss...

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:48.040
Why'd you slink away from the cavalry like that?

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.200
You can't expect us to-

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.110
Aren't you men? Pitiful!

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:52.340
But Boss...

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.310
No excuses!

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:58.410
First that girl makes fools of you and then you run into the cavalry!

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:00.940
Good grief! What a terrible day!

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.570
Why am I... having such...

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:21.000
...a lousy meal... in a place like this?!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:26.670
Right now, I'm supposed to be eating a warm meal at a tavern somewhere!

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:30.610
We ran into the cavalry at a bad time...

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:31.750
R-Right...

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:34.480
We have to lay low for a while.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.150
Shut up! I know that!

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.350
Then don't be so unreasonable.

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:40.620
Don't give me that!

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:44.160
This all happened because you're both good-for-nothings!

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:46.930
But it's okay... this bread is delicious.

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:50.330
Idiot! That's not what I'm talking about!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:54.030
I can't just leave things like this!

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:55.840
What're you going to do?

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.100
Around this hour...

00:12:57.100 --> 00:13:00.070
They're probably having lunch, too.

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:02.040
I see... So?

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:04.810
If we check the taverns and inns, we'll be sure to find them.

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:07.010
Who's going to go and find them?

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:09.120
You are, of course!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.320
What?! Search the entire town?!

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:14.160
And what'll we do if we do find them?

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:16.720
Never mind. Get going and find them.

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.130
Uh, okay.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:22.320
I'll teach them what happens when they cross me!

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:27.330
This is a nice place...

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:30.540
Prontera has the best.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:34.540
Yes. I come here often when I'm in Prontera.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.610
I never knew of such a place.

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:38.980
It's been a long time since
I've been in Prontera.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:42.520
I see. You haven't been to Prontera in awhile?

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:45.520
But back then, there weren't people like that...

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:49.490
Don't worry, I'll protect you, Yuufa.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.990
It was Sir Helman who rescued us back there...

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:54.030
That's... That's not so!

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:56.600
Are you two a couple?

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:59.470
Huh?! No, uh...

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:01.670
No, we're just childhood friends.

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:02.640
Huh?!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:06.970
Do you have a boyfriend, Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.380
Oh... forgive me.

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:11.610
Yuufa-<i>san...</i>

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:14.520
What do you think of what's been happening lately in the world?

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:17.690
Huh? Happening in the world?

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:19.750
Monsters are becoming more violent,

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:24.730
and the world is being devastated by earthquakes and tsunamis.

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:30.060
As a result, it's not just the world, but people's souls that are decaying.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:32.970
Like the people we met earlier.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.340
Eh...

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:36.300
They are unstable.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.340
They aren't innately bad people.

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:41.280
A disturbing trend has them under its control.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.140
I-I wonder about that.

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:45.780
They looked pretty bad to me.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:49.220
No. The disturbing trend is to blame.

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:53.220
Something must be done.
Don't you think so?

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:54.090
I see...

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:56.590
But you're talking to two mere adventurers...

00:14:56.590 --> 00:15:00.690
I was wondering... why do you wear a blindfold, Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:02.160
Yuufa...

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:03.260
This is...

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.130
I am in training.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.200
It helps to improve my concentration.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:09.140
That is why I wear this.

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.640
Do blinders help with that?

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.480
I dunno.

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:16.340
I...

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:22.540
I am on a quest for the ultimate truth to save the people of this world.

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.190
There they are, Boss.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:30.720
Shall we get them?

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.090
No...

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:33.890
I'll use this.

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:35.130
A branch from a dead tree...

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:37.600
Are you planning to summon a monster?

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.230
You don't have to use that-

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:42.070
The two of us will give it to them good.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:43.870
No, that woman...

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:46.470
Isn't someone you two can handle.

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:48.780
She dodged my knife...

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.510
She's no ordinary woman.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.650
But...

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:53.480
If a terrible one should appear...

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:55.350
Aren't you men?!

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.340
Don't go getting scared!

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:01.950
Argh!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:06.660
What was that?

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:09.630
Huh? What's going on?
Something's happening outside.

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:18.640
What the-

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.480
The clock tower manager...

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:24.310
Clock tower manager?!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:33.820
What's the clock tower manager doing here?!

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:35.650
How should I know?!

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:46.970
Why you-

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:49.640
No! Take refuge this way!

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:51.770
The Prontera Cavalry will be here shortly!

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:52.870
Captain!

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:54.440
Excuse me, sir...

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:56.080
What's all the commotion?

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.280
Th-the clock tower...

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.350
Huh?

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.580
Boss, look what we've done!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:03.920
What'll we do?!

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:07.950
It's their fault for making us angry!

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.490
We've got to get out of here now!

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:13.090
Yuufa-<i>san</i>, do you have any skills?

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:13.930
Huh?

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:16.200
I uh... I can use White Magic.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.400
All right...

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.170
Then let's take care of this ourselves.

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:21.400
Eh?!

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.640
Yuufa-<i>san</i>, you watch my back.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.670
I will recite an incantation.

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:28.640
Roan-<i>san</i>, you buy me the time I'll need.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:31.680
B... But... I think now is the time to run!

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:34.480
We can try again when we're more ready...

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:35.750
Roan...

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:38.650
I do not believe people who won't fight today

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.250
but say they'll fight another day.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:41.960
B... But...

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:45.630
Aren't you going to protect Yuufa-<i>san</i>?

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:46.990
I like that look in your eyes...

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:47.980
Let's do it.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:51.870
Come at me!

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:53.330
Careful, Roan!

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:55.670
Leave him to me, Yuufa!

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:03.270
Why you!

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:06.940
This thing's fast!

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:09.120
Roan!

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.220
Hurry up, Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:13.280
Cold Bolt!

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:19.630
Hey, watch it!

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.290
Once more!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:24.630
Frost...

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:27.300
...Diver!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.910
Incredible!

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:33.140
Now the final blow!

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:36.640
Meet your end, you spring-loaded freak!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:40.750
<i>Look at me, Yuufa, don't I look great?</i>

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:41.980
No, you mustn't!

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:42.470
Huh?

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:58.800
Roan!

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.000
Heal him!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.030
Oh, right.

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:01.930
Heal!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.110
Don't move!

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:10.910
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:11.610
Cold-

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.280
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:20.850
She's lovely...

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:23.320
Are you all right, Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:24.590
Use your magic!

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:26.760
My blindfold! My blindfold!

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:27.490
Huh?

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:29.500
I'm powerless...

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:32.530
Powerless without my blindfold!

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:34.370
What?!

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:35.960
Holy Light!

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:38.960
Yuufa!

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.300
Run, Yuufa!

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:49.980
Stay away from Yuufa!

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:53.990
Roan!

00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:00.660
Roan... Roan!

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:07.990
Holy Light! Holy Light!

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:15.010
Why won't it fall...

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:17.340
Brother?

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:21.180
Roan! Roan!

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:22.380
<i>Damn...</i>

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.980
<i>Have I failed...</i>

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:27.990
<i>...to protect Yuufa?</i>

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:30.090
<i>I was entrusted with her...</i>

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:32.560
<i>Have I failed, after all?</i>

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:35.360
Cold Bolt!

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:40.300
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:41.740
What are you doing?!

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.970
Get up, Roan!

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:47.030
Why do you wield that sword?

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:55.150
I wield this sword...

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.880
...to protect Yuufa!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:05.060
Is that-

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:06.490
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:07.830
Just a little more...

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:11.900
The Prontera Cavalry has arrived!

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:12.990
Sir Helman!

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:17.770
Now, Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:19.500
Lightning...

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:22.680
...Bolt!

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:41.190
We did it...

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:43.690
We did it!
We've defeated it!

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:47.270
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:49.270
I still have much to learn...

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:51.040
Are any of you hurt?

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:53.040
No, we managed somehow.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.510
The three of you defeated the clock tower manager alone?

00:21:56.510 --> 00:21:59.550
Yes... but it was mostly thanks to Takius-<i>san.</i>

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:01.980
Well, I must be going...

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:03.020
Huh?

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:04.790
Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:07.820
What is your rush?
Why not stay?

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:11.430
I'd like to show the cavalry's appreciation for what you've done.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:13.230
No thank you.

00:22:13.230 --> 00:22:17.930
I am on a mission to pursue the ultimate truth.

00:22:17.930 --> 00:22:19.530
Goodbye.

00:22:19.530 --> 00:22:22.000
I'm sure we will meet again somewhere.

00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:25.970
<i>If that is our destiny...</i>

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:29.000
<i>Takius, the magician...</i>

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:37.010
<i>A problem in the sewers prompts Roan</i> <i>and his friends go to investigate,</i>

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:38.350
<i>but what awaits them.</i>

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:41.010
<i>Next time: "Be Good to Me, Big Brother."</i>

00:23:42.180 --> 00:23:45.350
<i>Join us again.</i>
